{"id": null, "n": "0653001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0653001", "type": "orig", "text": "開疑中"}
{"id": null, "n": "0654001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0654001", "type": "orig", "text": "直疑真"}
{"id": null, "n": "0672001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0672001", "type": "orig", "text": "哉疑也"}
{"id": null, "n": "0673001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0673001", "type": "orig", "text": "盡當作多"}
{"id": null, "n": "0673002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0673002", "type": "orig", "text": "言疑意"}
{"id": null, "n": "0682001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0682001", "type": "orig", "text": "例疑到"}
{"id": null, "n": "0687001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0687001", "type": "orig", "text": "至疑主"}
{"id": null, "n": "0696001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0696001", "type": "orig", "text": "及疑乃"}
{"id": null, "n": "0696002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0696002", "type": "orig", "text": "罪疑無"}
{"id": null, "n": "0696003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0696003", "type": "orig", "text": "視疑現"}
{"id": null, "n": "0704001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0704001", "type": "orig", "text": "體下佚失十八行行十八字此佚失中宗鏡科有空生聞說是經解義趣而悲流雨淚仙人垂慈弘忍笑雪刃而謾斬虛空如是印可其詞能離一切諸相未審感悟處有何奇特之文"}
{"id": null, "n": "0704002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0704002", "type": "orig", "text": "空下佚失十七行行十八字此佚失中宗鏡科有善吉親聞徹見源悲欣交集讚慈尊心空法明超真際堪報從前不報恩之文"}
